---
import ProseLayout from '../../layouts/ProseLayout.astro';
import { getBrand, site } from '../../config/site';
const brand = getBrand('en');
---

<ProseLayout
  locale="en"
  title="Terms of Use"
  description={`Terms and disclaimer to read before using ${brand.name}.`}
  path="/terms/"
>
  <p>By using {brand.name} (“the site”), you agree to the following terms.</p>
  <h2>The service</h2>
  <p>
    The site provides free online tools for general reference only. We may change, suspend or discontinue any tool at any time
    without notice.
  </p>
  <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
  <p>
    We work hard to make every calculation and conversion accurate, but we do not guarantee that results are error-free or fit for
    any particular purpose. For financial, medical, legal or other important decisions, rely on a qualified professional or
    official sources. The site is not liable for any loss arising from the use of its results.
  </p>
  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>
    Do not access the site with automated tools at high volume, interfere with its operation, or use it for anything unlawful.
  </p>
  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The design, text and code of the site are the copyright of {site.author}. Anything you create with the tools belongs to you.
  </p>
  <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Changes take effect when they are posted on this page.</p>
</ProseLayout>
